        "slc_d0b3193b7b414956670fc130dfc3f4fc639f6da6762799693dc4fe7fe9357e41"
      ],
      "text": "Sensory tools include aft_outline, aft_zoom, aft_search (hybrid semantic+lexical), aft_callgraph, aft_inspect, and trigram-indexed grep/glob backed by a file watcher."
    },
